shedman-tour(1)

# NAME

shedman-tour - first-run welcome tour overlay

# SYNOPSIS

*shedman tour*++
*shedos-tour*

# DESCRIPTION

A six-slide overlay shown on the first login: the Super-key
essentials, the touchpad gestures, *shedman* in thirty seconds, and
the safety story (snapshots, rollback, boot auto-recovery). Arrow
keys or clicks navigate; *Esc* skips; *Enter* on the last slide
opens the keybinding reference. Shown once per user
(*~/.local/state/shedos/tour-shown*); *shedman tour* replays it.

It takes no options of its own.

# SEE ALSO

*shedman*(1), *shedman-keybindings*(1)
